OL,3,ALucy Letby: Families' solicitor blames
OL,4,Ahospital bosses for police delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solicitor representing seven of the
OL,7,Ffamilies affected by Lucy Letby's
OL,8,Fcrimes has said responsibility for the
OL,9,Fdelay in contacting the police "lies
OL,10,Fsquarely" with hospital executives.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, the Thirlwall Inquiry
OL,13,Freport revealed bosses at the Countess
OL,14,Fof Chester Hospital repeatedly failed
OL,15,Fin their duty of candour to parents,
OL,16,Finvestigators and regulators.
OL,18,FTamlin Bolton said each of the 1,100
OL,19,Fpages of Lady Justice Thirlwall's
OL,20,Ffindings contained "another opportunity
OL,21,Fwhere action could have been taken".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
